ommitted instance identity for execution.')]:\n bind.append(dict(id=bid,material_id=mat,symbol=sym,start_line=a,end_line=z,description=desc,pending=[],associations=[dict(claim_id=claim,source_ids=ss,rationale=desc)]))\ncl=dict(id=claim,kind='obligation',concern='consensus_safety',description='Within the configured crash tolerance and static membership, once a replica commits a command batch for an origin/instance identity, recovery and later formation at another nonfailed replica must not commit a different command batch for that same identity, despite finite delay of the earlier Commit notification.',source_ids=ss,scope=dict(description='Preservation of committed command-batch identity across instance recovery in the fixed five-peer crash-stop configuration.',assumptions=['N=5,F=2,thrifty operation, one stopped participant','Non-Byzantine peers and intact messages','Finite asynchronous message delivery/dispatch, with independent per-type handler channels','Known missing slot may initiate recovery'],excluded=['Durable restart','Dynamic membership','Infinite-stall claims','Client completion or executed-state divergence','Isolation of one necessary root cause']),pending=[],grounding=g)\nfeedback=dict(ref_ids=['6195681062194053841c80dbea5f750e','5889f79a2ba84d4dbf016630607560c4','ec1ee8fa559b42e5beed5b951a4676bc','F_decision','B_recover_select','B_accept','S_accept','S_recover_start','S_recover_select','S_transport_recv','S_dispatch'],answered='The reviewed accepted-phase CheckRun 5889f79a2ba84d4dbf016630607560c4 confirms local phase 2 after positive acceptance and in the later Prepare report. Separate exploration 6195681062194053841c80dbea5f750e reached first COMMITTED commands [{Op:1,K:9,V:42}] at replica 1 and second COMMITTED NOOP at replica 3 for origin 1/slot 0, while the first remained committed. That exploration is construction knowledge only. Source permits independent enqueue/dispatch for decoded Commit versus PreAccept; the continuation exposes a known hole 